Third-party notices for the embedded jq
=======================================

The kaneo binary embeds jq 1.8.2, compiled to WebAssembly by jq-wasm 3.0.0-jq-1.8.2
(https://github.com/owenthereal/jq-wasm) with Emscripten 6.0.0, together with jq's bundled
Oniguruma and the musl libc that Emscripten links in. Their notices follow.


